DESCRIPTION:Charles Engle\n\nBorn and raised in Arizona\, Charles's comedy 
 blends personal vulnerability with the absurdity of everyday life\, deliver
 ing sharp observations with an honest and self-aware style. Now based in Ne
 w York he has performed at notable comedy festivals\, including the Big Pin
 e Comedy Festival\, the Seattle International Comedy Festival\, and the New
  York Comedy Festival. Charles has gained traction online with viral comedy
  videos on Instagram\, and tours with nationally touring comedians such as 
 Preacher Lawson\, Jessie Johnson\, and Shapel Lacey.\n\nColin Armstrong\n\n
 Colin Armstrong is a stand-up comedian born and raised in New Jersey. You m
 ight have heard his comedy on SiriusXM Radio\, recognized him from his vira
 l comedy videos\, or seen him headlining clubs across the country. A fixtur
 e of New Jersey's comedy scene\, Colin is a regular at every major club in 
 the state. He has toured with comics like Chris Gethard and Rachel Feinstei
 n\, won the 2024 Jersey Shore Top Comic Competition\, placed in the Top 8 a
 t The Riot Comedy Festival\, and was featured as an Emerging Artist at the 
 prestigious SF Sketchfest. All these accomplishments have really gone to hi
 s head.\n\nAges 18+\nFee applies if transferring confirmed ticket purchase 
 to another guest.\nDoors for open for seating approximately 30 minutes befo
 re late showtimes. Please note\, doors are subject to prior show endtime an
 d may change without notice\, beyond our control.\nNo refunds or exchanges.
